    "system_prompt": "Você é Logos-3, um agente de engenharia de software da família de modelos Conatus. Raciocine em <think>, use <tool_call name=\"...\"> quando precisar de uma ferramenta, e responda ao usuário só dentro de <final>.",
    "user_request": "Crie um dropdown de seleção de tamanho totalmente navegável por teclado (setas pra mover, Enter/Espaço pra confirmar, Esc pra fechar e devolver o foco ao botão), com os atributos ARIA corretos pra leitor de tela.",
    "raw_text": "<think>Um <select> nativo já resolveria acessibilidade de graça, mas o pedido é por um dropdown customizado — então preciso replicar manualmente o padrão ARIA 'Listbox': o botão que abre tem aria-haspopup='listbox' e aria-expanded refletindo o estado real de aberto/fechado (não hardcoded); a lista tem role='listbox', cada opção role='option' com aria-selected no item atual; aria-activedescendant no container aponta pro id da opção ativa, permitindo que o leitor de tela anuncie a seleção sem mover o foco DOM de verdade pra cada <li> (o foco real fica sempre no container, controlado via roving/activedescendant). Teclado: Seta baixo/cima move a seleção (com preventDefault pra não rolar a página), Enter/Espaço confirma e devolve foco ao botão, Esc fecha sem confirmar e devolve foco ao botão — nunca deixando o foco 'perdido' num elemento que sumiu.</think><tool_call name=\"write_file\">{\"path\": \"src/App.tsx\", \"content\": \"import { useRef, useState, KeyboardEvent } from \\\"react\\\";\\n\\nconst OPTIONS = [\\\"Pequeno\\\", \\\"Médio\\\", \\\"Grande\\\"];\\n\\nexport default function App() {\\n  const [open, setOpen] = useState(false);\\n  const [selectedIndex, setSelectedIndex] = useState(0);\\n  const buttonRef = useRef<HTMLButtonElement>(null);\\n\\n  function handleKeyDown(event: KeyboardEvent<HTMLDivElement>) {\\n    if (event.key === \\\"Escape\\\") {\\n      setOpen(false);\\n      buttonRef.current?.focus();\\n    } else if (event.key === \\\"ArrowDown\\\") {\\n      event.preventDefault();\\n      setSelectedIndex((i) => Math.min(i + 1, OPTIONS.length - 1));\\n    } else if (event.key === \\\"ArrowUp\\\") {\\n      event.preventDefault();\\n      setSelectedIndex((i) => Math.max(i - 1, 0));\\n    } else if (event.key === \\\"Enter\\\" || event.key === \\\" \\\") {\\n      event.preventDefault();\\n      setOpen(false);\\n      buttonRef.current?.focus();\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div>\\n      <button\\n        ref={buttonRef}\\n        aria-haspopup=\\\"listbox\\\"\\n        aria-expanded={open}\\n        onClick={() => setOpen((o) => !o)}\\n      >\\n        Tamanho: {OPTIONS[selectedIndex]}\\n      </button>\\n      {open && (\\n        <ul role=\\\"listbox\\\" aria-activedescendant={`opt-${selectedIndex}`} tabIndex={-1} onKeyDown={handleKeyDown} ref={(el) => el?.focus()}>\\n          {OPTIONS.map((opt, index) => (\\n            <li\\n              key={opt}\\n              id={`opt-${index}`}\\n              role=\\\"option\\\"\\n              aria-selected={index === selectedIndex}\\n              onClick={() => {\\n                setSelectedIndex(index);\\n                setOpen(false);\\n                buttonRef.current?.focus();\\n              }}\\n            >\\n              {opt}\\n            </li>\\n          ))}\\n        </ul>\\n      )}\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n}\\n\"}</tool_call><tool_result name=\"write_file\" status=\"ok\">{\"path\": \"src/App.tsx\", \"bytes_written\": 1728, \"mode\": \"overwrite\"}</tool_result><think>Vou buildar e renderizar de verdade pra confirmar que compila e monta sem erro de console.</think><tool_call name=\"checker\">{\"language\": \"typescript\", \"operation\": \"run\", \"files\": [{\"path\": \"src/App.tsx\", \"content\": \"import { useRef, useState, KeyboardEvent } from \\\"react\\\";\\n\\nconst OPTIONS = [\\\"Pequeno\\\", \\\"Médio\\\", \\\"Grande\\\"];\\n\\nexport default function App() {\\n  const [open, setOpen] = useState(false);\\n  const [selectedIndex, setSelectedIndex] = useState(0);\\n  const buttonRef = useRef<HTMLButtonElement>(null);\\n\\n  function handleKeyDown(event: KeyboardEvent<HTMLDivElement>) {\\n    if (event.key === \\\"Escape\\\") {\\n      setOpen(false);\\n      buttonRef.current?.focus();\\n    } else if (event.key === \\\"ArrowDown\\\") {\\n      event.preventDefault();\\n      setSelectedIndex((i) => Math.min(i + 1, OPTIONS.length - 1));\\n    } else if (event.key === \\\"ArrowUp\\\") {\\n      event.preventDefault();\\n      setSelectedIndex((i) => Math.max(i - 1, 0));\\n    } else if (event.key === \\\"Enter\\\" || event.key === \\\" \\\") {\\n      event.preventDefault();\\n      setOpen(false);\\n      buttonRef.current?.focus();\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div>\\n      <button\\n        ref={buttonRef}\\n        aria-haspopup=\\\"listbox\\\"\\n        aria-expanded={open}\\n        onClick={() => setOpen((o) => !o)}\\n      >\\n        Tamanho: {OPTIONS[selectedIndex]}\\n      </button>\\n      {open && (\\n        <ul role=\\\"listbox\\\" aria-activedescendant={`opt-${selectedIndex}`} tabIndex={-1} onKeyDown={handleKeyDown} ref={(el) => el?.focus()}>\\n          {OPTIONS.map((opt, index) => (\\n            <li\\n              key={opt}\\n              id={`opt-${index}`}\\n              role=\\\"option\\\"\\n              aria-selected={index === selectedIndex}\\n              onClick={() => {\\n                setSelectedIndex(index);\\n                setOpen(false);\\n                buttonRef.current?.focus();\\n              }}\\n            >\\n              {opt}\\n            </li>\\n          ))}\\n        </ul>\\n      )}\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n}\\n\"}], \"entrypoint\": \"index.html\", \"timeout_ms\": 60000}</tool_call><tool_result name=\"checker\" status=\"ok\">{\"passed\": true, \"errors\": [], \"stdout\": \"\\u001b[36mvite v5.4.21 \\u001b[32mbuilding for production...\\u001b[36m\\u001b[39m\\ntransforming...\\n\\u001b[32m✓\\u001b[39m 31 modules transformed.\\nrendering chunks...\\ncomputing gzip size...\\n\\u001b[2mdist/\\u001b[22m\\u001b[32mindex.html                \\u001b[39m\\u001b[1m\\u001b[2m  0.34 kB\\u001b[22m\\u001b[1m\\u001b[22m\\u001b[2m │ gzip:  0.25 kB\\u001b[22m\\n\\u001b[2mdist/\\u001b[22m\\u001b[36massets/index-D6JzsUku.js  \\u001b[39m\\u001b[1m\\u001b[2m217.55 kB\\u001b[22m\\u001b[1m\\u001b[22m\\u001b[2m │ gzip: 54.92 kB\\u001b[22m\\n\\u001b[32m✓ built in 562ms\\u001b[39m\\n\", \"stderr\": \"\", \"metadata\": {\"language\": \"typescri